  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Republic of Moldova - Reform Support Teams: Supporting implementation of Priority Reforms in Critical Infrastructure Sectors and Accelerating Progress towards EU Market integration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Republic of Moldova - Reform Support Teams: Supporting implementation of Priority Reforms in Critical Infrastructure Sectors and Accelerating Progress towards EU Market integration - This action will support the Republic of Moldova in the implementation of reforms linked to the EU-Moldova Association Agreement/Deep and Comprehensive Free Trade Area (DCFTA) and Association Agenda 2021-2027 with a particular focus on the following topics:-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;A continuation of the High Level Adviser&#xbf;s Mission-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Strengthen the Parliament&#xbf;s oversight functions and its institutional capacities.-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Enhancing the capacity and accountability of the justice sector at various levels.-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Support for the implementation of the Carabinieri&#xbf;s Reform Strategy-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Support for the establishment of a DNA (Deoxyribonucleic Acid) database accessible for EU Member States&#xbf; law enforcement agencies-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Support for the National Bureau of Statistics to conduct the 2023 population and housing census-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Support for increased visibility of EU assistance for the Republic of Moldova-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Support for the participation in EU programmes</narrative>
  </description>
